# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale fil, transcribed
# in chronologia/dayparts.py as the night band (18:00-00:00).  Surface: gabi,
# "evening/night".  CLDR fil labels BOTH its evening band (16:00-18:00) and
# its night band with gabi; the word is bound to night alone, the wider of
# the two, and the evening band ships no surface rather than a second reading
# of one word.  en.wiktionary.org, gabi.
gabi
